What are Gift Boxes?
Gift Boxes are pre designed containers crafted from paperboard, corrugated fiberboard, or specialty materials that protect and present products ranging from confectionery and cosmetics to premium electronics. They often incorporate decorative finishes, inserts, and branding elements that enhance perceived value and support gifting occasions.
